{"id": "t063-003", "text": "Laura and Ben are getting a puppy next Saturday, a cocker spaniel. They've already named him Biscuit.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Laura", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ben", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "getting a puppy", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Saturday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "cocker spaniel", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}]}
{"id": "t063-005", "text": "Need to post the graduation card to Keisha before Friday. Her ceremony is next Wednesday at 2pm.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "post the graduation card to Keisha", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before Friday", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "ceremony", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Wednesday at 2pm", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-008", "text": "Yasmin's son has his GCSE results on Thursday. She said he's convinced he's failed maths, but his teacher thinks he'll be fine.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Yasmin", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "GCSE results", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "convinced he's failed maths", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "teacher", "owner": "r1"}]}
{"id": "t063-016", "text": "Don't forget to send Rafael the photos from the christening. He asked twice now.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send Rafael the photos from the christening", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "send", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Rafael", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "christening", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "baby", "followup": "none"}]}
{"id": "t063-017", "text": "Dawit's little boy lost his first tooth this morning and is extremely proud of himself.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Dawit", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "little boy", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first tooth", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t063-019", "text": "Jakub is struggling with his dissertation. Deadline is Friday at 5pm and he's barely sleeping. I should check in with him on Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jakub", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "struggling", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "dissertation", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at 5pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with him", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
{"id": "t063-022", "text": "Coffee with Jorge went well. He's training for the Manchester half marathon in April and has finally sorted his knee out after months of physio. He runs with a club on Tuesday and Thursday evenings now and does a long run on Sunday mornings. He's thinking about a full marathon next year if the half goes well. He also mentioned he's started baking sourdough, which I did not see coming.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Jorge", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "Manchester half marathon", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "performance", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "in April", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "i1", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "runs with a club", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday and Thursday evenings"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday mornings"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "thinking about a full marathon", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "next year"}, {"id": "i2", "type": "INTEREST", "text": "baking sourdough", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t063-025", "text": "Joy's niece is graduating from Edinburgh next Friday morning. Joy is driving up on Thursday night with her sister and coming back Sunday. Her niece did a degree in marine biology and has already been offered a research post in Aberdeen starting in January. Joy is so proud she showed me the photos from the offer email.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "graduating from Edinburgh", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Friday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "driving up", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Thursday night", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "sister", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "Sunday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "niece", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "degree in marine biology", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "job"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "offered", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "e4", "type": "EVENT", "text": "research post in Aberdeen", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "in January", "anchor": "e4"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Joy", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "proud", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t063-026", "text": "Santiago is coming to stay this weekend. He arrives Friday at about 8pm. I need to make up the spare room and buy some decent coffee before then.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "coming to stay", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday at about 8pm", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "make up the spare room", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "buy some decent coffee", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "before then", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t063-029", "text": "Alana's daughter got into the grammar school! Alana cried telling me about it on the phone this evening. They found out this morning and apparently her daughter screamed so loudly the neighbours came round to check everything was alright. She starts in September and they're already panicking about the bus route. Send flowers or something this week, and maybe a little card for her daughter too.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "got into the grammar school", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "congratulate"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "this evening"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "this morning"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r3", "type": "RELATION", "text": "neighbours", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "starts", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "school", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in September", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "panicking about the bus route", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Send flowers", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "this week", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "a little card for her daughter", "owner": "r1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "r4", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}]}
{"id": "t063-031", "text": "Had a long catch-up with Keisha. Her brother Eli is moving to Bristol next month for a new job at the university, and their mum is not handling it well at all. Keisha is going down with him on the 3rd to help with the move. She also mentioned she fancies doing a pottery course in the new year, maybe on Tuesday evenings.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "brother", "owner": "p2", "fact_type": "relationship"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Eli", "owner": "p1", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "moving to Bristol", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "move", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "next month", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the university", "owner": "p2", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "mum", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "not handling it well", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Keisha", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e3", "type": "EVENT", "text": "going down", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the 3rd", "anchor": "e3"}, {"id": "f3", "type": "FACT", "text": "fancies doing a pottery course", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "in the new year"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Tuesday evenings"}]}
{"id": "t063-032", "text": "Haruto's son has his piano exam on Saturday at half 10. Grade 3. He's been practising every night after dinner and Haruto says the whole street now knows the pieces by heart. The poor kid is really nervous about the sight-reading part. Haruto and his wife are both taking him, then going for pancakes afterwards whatever happens.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "son", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "piano exam", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday at half 10", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "every night after dinner"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about the sight-reading part", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "p3", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Haruto", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "wife", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "afterwards", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-037", "text": "Ben's starting his new job at the council on Monday morning. He's really nervous about the commute.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Ben", "pronoun": "he"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new job at the council", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "nervous about the commute", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t063-039", "text": "Zeynep's daughter had her first swimming lesson today and refused to get out of the pool at the end.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Zeynep", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "daughter", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "first swimming lesson", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "other", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "today", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "the end", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-040", "text": "Text Khadija good luck before her OSCE exam on Monday morning. She is absolutely terrified of it.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "Text Khadija good luck", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "wish_luck", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Khadija", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "before", "anchor": "a1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "OSCE exam", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "exam", "followup": "wish_luck"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "Monday morning", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "terrified", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}]}
{"id": "t063-048", "text": "Elif rang. Her dad had a fall at the weekend and is in a cast for six weeks. She's going over every evening after work to help him. I should send her a meal voucher or drop something round on Wednesday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Elif", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "dad", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "fall", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "the weekend", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "in a cast", "owner": "r1", "fact_type": "health"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "six weeks"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "every evening after work"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "send her a meal voucher", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "a2", "type": "ACTION", "text": "drop something round", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "gift", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday", "anchor": "a2"}]}
{"id": "t063-049", "text": "Aditi Kim is my new manager from Monday. She used to work at the BBC.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Aditi Kim", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "new manager", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "job", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "from Monday", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "used to work at the BBC", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "other"}]}
{"id": "t063-053", "text": "Need to organise the playdate with Santiago's kids. Maybe Saturday afternoon, or next Sunday if the weather's bad.", "spans": [{"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "organise the playdate with Santiago's kids", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "other", "timing": "before"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "playdate", "owner": "r1", "event_type": "party", "followup": "none"}, {"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Santiago", "pronoun": "unknown"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "Saturday afternoon", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "next Sunday", "anchor": "e1"}]}
{"id": "t063-056", "text": "Long call with Alana tonight. Her dog Juno was diagnosed with diabetes last week, so it's insulin injections twice a day now, morning and evening. Alana's finding it really hard to fit around work and the kids' swimming. Her husband is away until Thursday as well. I offered to walk Juno on Wednesday afternoon. Should check in with her again on Friday.", "spans": [{"id": "p1", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "d1", "type": "DATE", "text": "tonight"}, {"id": "f1", "type": "FACT", "text": "dog Juno", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "pet"}, {"id": "e1", "type": "EVENT", "text": "diagnosed with diabetes", "owner": "p1", "event_type": "medical", "followup": "check_in"}, {"id": "d2", "type": "DATE", "text": "last week", "anchor": "e1"}, {"id": "d3", "type": "DATE", "text": "morning and evening"}, {"id": "p2", "type": "PERSON", "text": "Alana", "pronoun": "she"}, {"id": "f2", "type": "FACT", "text": "finding it really hard", "owner": "p1", "fact_type": "feeling"}, {"id": "r1", "type": "RELATION", "text": "kids", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "r2", "type": "RELATION", "text": "husband", "owner": "p1"}, {"id": "e2", "type": "EVENT", "text": "away", "owner": "r2", "event_type": "travel", "followup": "ask_outcome"}, {"id": "d4", "type": "DATE", "text": "until Thursday", "anchor": "e2"}, {"id": "d5", "type": "DATE", "text": "Wednesday afternoon"}, {"id": "a1", "type": "ACTION", "text": "check in with her again", "owner": "p1", "anchor": "e1", "action_type": "check_in", "timing": "after"}, {"id": "d6", "type": "DATE", "text": "Friday", "anchor": "a1"}]}
